WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.740
- [Gary] I think that 
most people that are

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:03.169
not nice to other people,

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:06.338
are broken inside
and are unhappy inside.

00:00:06.338 --> 00:00:10.900
And I think through
real psychological work,

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.782
therapy, real self-evaluation,
really hitting rock bottom,

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:18.885
some shock to the system
like taking a year vacation or

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:22.522
getting a divorce or having that
conversation with their father

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:25.588
about that thing that
happened when they were 11.

00:00:25.588 --> 00:00:28.194
I mean there's a million things

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.630
that I do think
can unlock a dream.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.600
I think they're the hardest
things in the world to do and

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.937
I don't take it lightly.

00:00:34.937 --> 00:00:39.404
I've not been able to do it so
easily so I don't think it's

00:00:39.404 --> 00:00:41.574
easy but I do
think it's achievable.

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:44.043
I think it takes an enormous
amount of self reflection,

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:48.581
acceptance and humility on the
part of the person that's doing

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:51.918
the actions and it takes a
complete reset of who they are

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:54.988
from a hardwiring standpoint
and so I would say yes,

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:58.424
but 99% of people
I don't think will pull it off.

00:00:58.424 --> 00:00:59.662
And I mean that, by the way.

00:00:59.662 --> 00:01:00.793
It's very hard.

00:01:00.793 --> 00:01:04.656
(intense music)

